# Never commit: generated data, session state, handoffs, editor backups.
# A `git add -A` during the package refactor swept 18424 data files, the .omo
# session directory and ten HANDOFF notes into a commit; these rules make that
# mistake impossible rather than merely discouraged.
data/
.omo/
HANDOFF*.md
*.bak
graphify-out/

# stray outputs that used to land in the repo root
/gen_*.vtk
/*_toklines.*
